'''Trudgen''' was a [[humanoid]] [[Gender|male]] [[Force-sensitive]] who served as a member of the [[Knights of Ren]], under the command of an individual known as [[Ren (human)|Ren]],<ref name="The Rise of Kylo Ren 1" /> and later [[Ben Solo|Kylo Ren]].<ref name="Episode IX" />

==Biography==
===Fall of the New Republic===
Having been summoned by [[Ben Solo|Kylo Ren]], Trudgen, along with the other members of the [[Knights of Ren]], gathered to answer his call. All of the Knights accepted Ren without question, pointing out that the results of his past trial still stood.<ref name="TROS Expanded Edition" />

===Battle of Exegol===
[[File:Death_of_Trudgen.png|thumb|left|250px|Trudgen was killed by Ben Solo, the former master of the Knights of Ren.]]
A short time after the hunt for Rey, Trudgen and the other Knights of Ren were lurking in the [[Sith Citadel]] of [[Darth Sidious]] on [[Exegol]]. During the [[Battle of Exegol]], the redeemed Ben Solo entered the citadel to save [[Rey Skywalker|Rey]].<ref name="Episode IX" />

Before Solo could reach the [[Throne of the Sith]], Trudgen and the Knights confronted their [[Ren|former leader]]. The Knights were able to swiftly overwhelm the [[Jedi]] in his unarmed state, forcing him to the ground and beating him. However, through the use of their [[Force-bond]], Rey was able to give Solo his [[Skywalker lightsaber|grandfather's lightsaber]]. With [[Anakin Skywalker]]'s [[lightsaber]], Solo swiftly cut down [[Kuruk]] and [[Cardo]] before [[Force push]]ing [[Ap'lek]] into a pit, and then cutting [[Vicrul]] down. Afterwards Trudgen attempted to attack Solo, but was effortlessly stabbed in the chest before he could swing [[Trudgen's vibrocleaver|his vibrocleaver]].<ref name="Episode IX" />

==Personality and traits==
Trudgen was among the most ferocious of the Knights. He was obsessed with collecting trophies from his victims which he would frequently use to decorate his armor.<ref name="SWE">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref>

==Powers and abilities==
Trudgen was [[Force-sensitive]] and an adept of the [[dark side of the Force]] but he was untrained which made his powers stunted.<ref name="IX Visual Dictionary">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> As his fellow Knights, Trudgen's fighting skills and [[Unarmed combat|martial prowess]] were without equal.<ref name="USW,NE">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref> A remarkable achievement performed by Trudgen in the past was defeating a [[death trooper]], given the death [[trooper]]s' strength and rarity.<ref name="IX Visual Dictionary" /> Although he was a very powerful individual, he was quickly killed with a stab through his chest by his redeemed former leader, Ben Solo, during the Battle of [[Exegol]].<ref name="Episode IX" />

==Equipment==
[[File:Trudgen-SWCT.png|thumb|right|250px|Trudgen wielding his vibrocleaver]]
A collector of trophies from fallen conquests, Trudgen used to add the weapons and [[armor]]s from previous victories. His patchwork [[helmet]], for example, once belonged to a death trooper he defeated in the past.<ref name="IX Visual Dictionary" />

Trudgen's signature weapon was an enormous [[vibrocleaver]], another of his trophies. The vibrocleaver was made of crucible steel with [[phrik]] or [[beskar]] filaments. Although his weapon could be cut through by a lightsaber, it would require great pressure to do so. The primitive weapon was modified with ultrasonic technology that vibrates the blade to give it extra cutting power. When not in use Trudgen would put the blunt end over his shoulder on weight-reducing holes along the weapon's spine or he would put it on a [[bandolier]] over his back. Trudgen also carried a large secondary blade sheathed on his torso.<ref name="IX Visual Dictionary" />

Trudgen wore all black like the rest of the Knights of Ren. He wore a heavy tabard and hood with scavenged armor plates all along his torso. Trudgen wore a helmet that was partially created from the helmet of a death trooper he killed.<ref name="IX Visual Dictionary" />

==Behind the scenes==
Trudgen was portrayed by stunt performer [[Tom Rodgers]] for the [[2019]] film [[Star Wars: Episode IX The Rise of Skywalker|''Star Wars'': Episode IX ''The Rise of Skywalker'']],<ref name="Instagram">{{Instagram|username=tomrodgersstunts|url=p/B6QF3NdAKRV|name=[[Tom Rodgers]]|date=December 19, 2019|quote=I'm a topps card and action figure 🤷🏻♂️ Turns out dreams do come true, in Star Wars; Rise of Skywalker I played one of the Knights of Ren... Watching Darth Maul growing up inspired me on my path to where I am today so playing a Sith like him feels unreal. Thanks to Mikey Lambert and [[Wikipedia:Eunice Huthart|Eunice Huthart]] for the opportunity|archiveurl=https://archive.is/46AIV}}</ref> who was listed as "Knight of Ren" in the film's credit.

